---
layout: base.njk
title: Case studies
description: "Five fictional agency case studies from Inflowwww. Each one teaches a real practice you can copy: onboarding, shift handovers, PPV reviews, backups and chat QA."
---
<section class="wrap pt-16 pb-20 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-28">
  <p class="eyebrow">Case studies</p>
  <h1 class="h-page mt-4">We haven't helped thousands grow. Here is what we can say.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Fictional, and labelled so. Real users have not written in yet. The agencies and the people are made up. The feature names, the arithmetic
    and the practice in each study are real, and each practice works with or without our software.
  </p>
  <ul class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    {%- for study in collections.caseStudy | newestFirst %}
    <li class="card flex flex-col md:first:col-span-2">
      <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-sm">
        <span class="badge-parody">Fictional</span>
        {%- if study.data.agency %}<span class="text-muted">{{ study.data.agency }}</span>{% endif %}
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance">
        <a class="hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4" href="{{ study.url | url }}">{{ study.data.title }}</a>
      </h2>
      {%- if study.data.description %}
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">{{ study.data.description }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if study.data.stats and study.data.stats.length > 1 %}
      <dl class="mt-auto grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-5">
        {%- for stat in study.data.stats.slice(0, 2) %}
        <div class="flex flex-col-reverse justify-end rounded-2xl bg-white px-4 py-3">
          <dt class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">{{ stat.label }}</dt>
          <dd class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight tabular-nums">{{ stat.value }}</dd>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </dl>
      {%- endif %}
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

{% include "deploy-band.njk" %}
